So what does Joe learn from this?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:36.943
Not much.

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:40.510
He carries this, do what you
love philosophy into death

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.000
as he tries to help 22 find her spark

